# Build and test output
**/bin/
**/obj/
/artifacts/
**/TestResults/

# Local IDE state (shared VS Code tasks and launch profiles are committed)
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
.vscode/settings.json

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

